  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Frozzle introduces kosher freeze-dried candy. Certified by KSA.&nbsp;This cutting-edge treat combines the crunch of freeze-drying with a unique and satisfying experience. Our innovative process intensifies flavor, creates a light &amp; crunchy texture. Made with exceptional quality and freshness, these treats are perfect for gifting, sharing, or satisfying your sweet tooth.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Airheads but now crunchy! It's almost like bitting into a fruit flavored crunchy cookie, perfectly sweet and the best little treat for all ages! Each bite delivers a burst of flavor and a satisfying crunch that will leave you wanting more. Flavors- watermelon, blue raspberry, white mystery, cherry, orange and grape.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Imagine fruit roll ups in crunchy form stuffed with vanilla marshmallow for the ultimate sweet crunch and with double the flavor! That's what happens when we unroll, stuff and freeze dry them. Each Roll up is packed with intense flavor and a satisfyingly crunchy texture.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Freeze Dried Rainbow Crunch are light, crunchy and full of bursting flavors! Definitely a MUST try! The freeze-drying process takes out all the water moisture from the candies, leaving you with something you can take with you anywhere, enjoy anytime, and one of the best parts about it is when you get past that first crunch, it starts to dissolve in your mouth.&nbsp;<span></span></p>",
